## 4. Verification

```bash
cd ~/mvcc
go vet ./...
go test -v -count=1 ./...
go test -race -count=1 ./...
```

Observed output:

```
=== RUN   TestWriteSkew
--- PASS: TestWriteSkew (0.00s)
=== RUN   TestRandomizedSerializable
--- PASS: TestRandomizedSerializable (0.25s)
=== RUN   TestBrokenModeProducesAnomalies
    mvcc_test.go:298: broken mode produced 262 anomalies in 2000 schedules
--- PASS: TestBrokenModeProducesAnomalies (0.04s)
=== RUN   TestGCReclaimsOldVersions
--- PASS: TestGCReclaimsOldVersions (0.00s)
=== RUN   TestGCKeepsSnapshotVisible
--- PASS: TestGCKeepsSnapshotVisible (0.00s)
PASS
